## Done means

Evidence, not assertion. A change is done when something ran and I read the
output; a ticket is done when its acceptance criteria were read *at closing time*
and each clause has evidence behind it. Where a clause is genuinely out of scope,
I say so in the closing note rather than letting the closure imply it was met.
